{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33995","headline":"友人以人参见惠因以诗谢之 · 皮日休","name":"友人以人参见惠因以诗谢之","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"神草延年出道家，是谁披露记三桠。\n开时的定涵云液，斸後还应带石花。\n名士寄来消酒渴，野人煎处撇泉华。\n从今汤剂如相续，不用金山焙上茶。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皮日休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33995.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33995","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}